		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Amp Armor</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Electrified armor that shocks nearby foes.</em></p><p><strong>Free Reaction.</strong> When you Defend, gain Charged and adjacent enemies take STR Lightning damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Teleport up to your speed after the attack resolves.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> +1 Armor.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STR Lightning against adjacent enemies.</em></p><p><em>[M] Give yourself Charged, then teleport up to your speed after the attack resolves.</em></p>",
